UE4SS (RE-UE4SS)
  Project: https://github.com/UE4SS-RE/RE-UE4SS
  License: MIT License, Copyright (c) the UE4SS contributors
  Not included in this repository or the image. At install time
  scripts/install-ue4ss.sh downloads the pinned release (from this project's
  release mirror of the pinned builds, because the upstream tag moves, then from
  https://github.com/UE4SS-RE/RE-UE4SS/releases; tag and asset named in that
  script) into the operator's own volume and verifies its SHA-256. Layout files
  for a build come only from the operator's own set, never from here. The loader
  archive is served from the server's own web root to the player launcher in
  client/. A mod listed from GitHub or CurseForge is downloaded by the player from
  that site; only a mod the operator puts in client-mods/ is re-hosted. The release
  archive carries its own LICENSE, which applies.

